WEBVTT

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:23.790
Your initials I wrote in my notebook

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:31.600
Discreetly overlapping so they won't be noticed

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.110
I stretched up

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:42.110
The school building I looked up at and the distant sky

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:53.690
The moon in broad daylight shows some restraint and lingers inside the light.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:01.310
I want these feelings to reach you

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.520
my heart

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:11.500
I embrace the small bud of passion that sprouted in my heart

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:13.880
I close my eyes

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:18.170
Some day I want to make it bloom into a big flower

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.750
someday

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:26.940
Our fluttering hearts connected, our eyes exchanging a glance

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:50.460
Looks like the girls aren't here yet.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.480
Yeah...

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:52.480
Listen.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:55.200
I'll try and make the part tonight as enjoyable as possible.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.640
The important part comes later.

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:00.700
I'll draw Morisaki away.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.100
Then you and Yoshizuki will be alone together.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.650
I brought plenty of alcohol.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:08.160
All you need is the guts!

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:11.010
Confess your feelings, knock her off her feet.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.030
Do whatever you want. Just don't act like you usually do.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.740
I can't even tell if you're joking or serious.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:21.840
Do you think I'd go to all this effort for a joke?

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.490
Don't forget, you already got rid of Itsuki-chan.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:28.040
Now it's your responsibility to confess your feelings to Yoshizuki.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.270
Teratani's always been like this.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.850
He's always been frustrated by my indecisive attitude.

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:40.560
And yet, he'd always try to get myself and Iori-chan together.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.000
Even after Itsuki left me...

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:49.310
Itsuki went back to America last winter.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.610
Her face was clear and bright when she'd said:

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.110
This is an order! Hurry up and make Iori-san yours.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.340
Itsuki, I don't think it's as easy as that.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.270
I mean, I've already given up on her once.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:20.550
The seasons changed from winter to spring.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:25.460
The distance between Iori-chan and myself returned to how it had been a year before.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.940
Then summer came again.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:41.030
A training camp for the college entrance exam?

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:45.410
Yeah. My relatives own an inn in Izu.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.080
I've already asked Yoshizuki to come. Why don't you come too?

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.900
What's with that lame response?

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:56.080
This is a good chance to get close to Yoshizuki again!

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:57.520
But I...

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:01.130
Itsuki-chan wouldn't be happy to know you're still hesitating like that.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:07.360
She went to America because she realised how you really feel, didn't she?

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:11.070
If you can't even be honest with yourself, it'll just be for nothing.

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:18.540
If you don't move, nothing will change.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.510
Well then, let me take those bags for you.

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:37.590
Um, where are Teratani-kun and the others?

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:42.390
They said they were going swimming. They're probably down at the beach.

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:46.510
What kind of study time is that?!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.000
They've just come here for fun, haven't they?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:05.910
Are you all right?

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.840
Another big wave's coming.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.010
But...

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:15.870
Is something wrong?

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.990
Yes. It seems that I dropped my ring in the water.

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:20.880
Your ring?

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:21.670
Yes.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.880
Was that ring important to you?

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.850
Well, I got it from my boyfriend.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.850
Can I borrow this for a second?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.800
I'll go and look for it.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.990
But your clothes...

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:39.200
Oh...

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.900
Don't worry about it.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:05:59.920
Is this it?

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:03.130
That's it! Thanks!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:12.010
You idiot!

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.610
Hey! What the heck are you doing?

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.320
Are you... still alive?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.050
Are you all right?

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.140
Yeah, the salt water just stings a little.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:56.470
My boyfriend gave me that ring on this spot last year.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.090
I see.

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:00.630
But we broke up a week ago.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:06.200
It was a really nasty break up, so I just had to throw it away here.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:07.410
I get it.

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:10.650
Can I ask your name at least?

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:13.640
My name is Izumi. Isozaki Izumi.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.850
Oh, I'm Seto Ichitaka.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:19.230
Seto-san, do you have a girlfriend?

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:20.800
N-No! Of course not!

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:22.020
Really?

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:24.470
What reason would I have to lie?

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:28.090
Then, what if I ask you to go out with me?

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:35.990
Well, um... you know... we just met today.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.490
We barely even know each other.

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:40.590
I'm just kidding.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.440
Seto-san, you're really naïve.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:46.330
Well, I'll be going now.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.270
I hope we'll see each other again.

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:55.700
What the heck am I doing?

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.160
Where have you been all this time?

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.040
Walking. Just walking.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.360
By yourself this whole time?

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:09.750
Suspicious! You're hiding something, aren't you?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.760
About what?!

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:15.050
Seto-kun, long time no see!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:18.260
You came really late. We've been waiting for you.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.380
Oh, sorry.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.520
I had to take care of something.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.290
That's—

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.480
A girl's handkerchief!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.500
What?! Oh, well... this is...

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:32.090
Ichitaka, you weren't...

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:35.300
...picking up girls at the beach, were you?

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:37.870
There's no way I'd do something like that!

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:44.040
Seto-san!

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:47.040
No way! We're staying at the same inn.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.000
W-Who are you?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.670
Geez, don't play dumb!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.420
I knew fate would bring us together again.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.550
W-Well...

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:58.230
Oh, by the way, how's your leg?

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.200
It's totally fine now.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:03.610
I'm glad! You got hurt because of me,

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:05.370
so I was worried about you.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.770
I'll go take a bath.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.260
Well, Seto-san, I'll see you later!

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.030
Seto...

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:21.790
Pretty good at picking up girls, aren't you?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.790
What? No! I wasn't picking up any girls!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.970
Oh! No, what? Huh?

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.920
You bastard, Ichitaka!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:35.760
After all I've done for you, you go cute girls like that behind my back!

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:39.760
Ichitaka.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:41.370
Teratani...

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.010
Why don't you cheer up?

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:45.980
I'll clear things up with Yoshizuki tomorrow.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.150
Really?

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.450
You've got a good friend, don't you?

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:53.430
Yeah. I'm glad I came here.

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:56.810
Now, why don't you go take a bath and refresh yourself?

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:57.480
Yes!

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.910
Divine punishment.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:14.400
Teratani... really is a nice guy.

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:17.130
Oh, no! Really?

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:20.240
Ah, so that's why!

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:23.050
Why is Iori-chan...?

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:27.600
Now, why don't you go take a bath and refresh yourself?

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:31.950
That bastard... He tricked me!

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:37.610
But anyway, isn't it great Seto came, Iori?

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:40.280
Wha— What do you mean?

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.180
Admit it!

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:44.330
You like Seto, don't you?

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.600
No, I don't really...

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:52.120
But you're closer to him than any other boy in the class.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:54.720
Well... that's because...

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:57.760
See? Come on and admit it!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:00.090
Come on!

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:03.720
I guess out of the boys in our class...

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:06.470
...I like him the most.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:10.290
What's with that "in our class" bit?

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:12.290
Can't you just spill it already?

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:14.230
Geez, Isn't that enough?

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:18.870
I want you to say it clearly, right now!

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:25.450
I... I just... Seto...

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:37.730
Ouch!

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:46.120
Oh, well... this is...

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.600
Nami, let's go.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.980
Seto. You are scum.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.420
Oh, hey, wait a second!

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:59.320
Weren't you just about to say what you thought of Seto-san?

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.360
Isozaki-san!

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.590
To me, Seto-kun is just another classmate.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:06.870
No more, no less.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:13.290
But right now, I don't even want to see his face.

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:29.070
I guess you should probably just forget about her.

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:32.180
It sounds like she isn't interested in you.

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:38.130
If she really liked you, she'd understand what happened.

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.950
She'd get that you were tricked into using the woman's bath.

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:43.940
At least she'd give you a chance, if she cared about you.

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:48.370
Hey, why don't you just forget about her?

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.490
It'll just make you sad.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.140
I think so too.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.580
I'm pretty used to the feeling.

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:58.060
But I really like her.

00:12:58.060 --> 00:12:59.090
Sounds pretty stupid, huh?

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.880
You really do sound stupid...

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:10.030
You can't forget, and you keep dragging it out...

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:11.720
I hate that.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:14.520
I really hate it!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:19.360
Isozaki-san? Where are you going?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.840
Leave me alone.

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:24.450
I said just leave me alone!

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.610
How can I just leave you alone after seeing your face like that?!

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:43.340
He was peeping the women's bath?!

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.980
Not even peeping! He was actually in the woman's bath!

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.010
He's unbelievable!

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:53.290
I never realised Seto was such a pervert.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:55.630
Why don't we just send him home tomorrow?

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:57.820
That's going too far.

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:02.730
He might have seen you naked. Are you really okay with that?

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.110
Um...

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:10.190
My deepest apologies for the interruption, but...

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:11.530
What?

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.700
Please forgive me!

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:20.620
What's this?

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:22.250
The cave of 51 stones!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.840
See all those stones in there?

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:28.340
There are 50 black stones and one white one.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:32.120
"If the guy stacks up all the black stones in a single column...

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:35.100
...and the girl puts the last white stone on top,

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:40.730
their love will be protected forever." or so the legend here says.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.830
What? You're kidding me.

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:52.170
It's impossible. There's no way to stack all fifty.

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:55.490
My ex-boyfriend whined the same way.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.290
Did he finish it?

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:59.070
Of course not!

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:00.580
He got mad and quit.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.410
Why didn't you make him finish it then?

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:06.630
He's not the kind of guy who'd listen.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.500
There's nothing wrong with listening to your girlfriend.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.180
He's a cold guy.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:15.390
He's not cold at all! He just got embarrassed!

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:23.150
That evening, he gave me that ring saying "I brought you something even better than the magic of the stones."

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.750
I have no right to criticise you, huh?

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.150
Just like you, I can't forget.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.210
But I finally got over it.

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:38.620
Yes, now I've cried about it, my mind is clear.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.420
Thank you, Seto-san.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.940
It was your prank?!

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:50.610
I just meant to surprise him a little.

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.770
You're the worst, Teratani!

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.210
Please don't say that!

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:57.470
I really feel bad. I'm sincerely apologising.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.390
It's too late to apologise!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:03.810
Iori?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:19.640
I didn't get the chance to say goodbye to Seto-san...

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.000
Izumi-chan!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.420
Good! I made it!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:32.070
What's wrong? You're soaking wet.

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:33.380
Here.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.590
This is...

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:38.970
It managed to avoid being swept away by the tide.

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:42.590
But why?

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:45.480
You still like him, don't you?

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.480
You're not really over him, are you?

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:55.090
You’re just like me. I can see it.

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:56.490
Seto-san...

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.970
Why don't you give it another shot?

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.480
Do it for my sake.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:06.920
Bye!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.040
Seto-san!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:12.630
If you really feel that way, can you do me a favour?

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.580
And why exactly am I doing this?

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.930
You want me and my ex to try again, right?

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.570
But why do I have to pile the stones?

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:28.900
I told you. You're substituting for my ex.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.180
Do you really think it'll work?

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:34.830
Stop complaining and just do it!

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:37.660
It can't be helped, I guess.

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:11.940
All right...

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:14.610
I did it. I finally did it!

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:17.150
Come on! The white stone! Hurry!

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:26.750
We did it!

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:31.380
You're surprised that it's not her, aren't you?

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:34.730
Yoshizuki, why are you here?

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:39.060
Izumi-chan asked me to do it, since you were so serious about it.

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:42.850
I'm sorry to call you out so suddenly.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:45.350
Is there something I can do for you?

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:49.260
Well, Seto-san is making a wish to this magic charm.

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:51.230
I was with him up until now,

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.410
but I can't stick around. I have to catch the train.

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:55.360
So?

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:59.610
Could I have you place this rock on top for me?

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.870
Did she say that?

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.850
And Izumi-chan also asked me to tell you:

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:13.470
"The message you gave me, I'm sending it back to you."

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:17.170
Why don't you give it another shot?

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:21.590
And also, your name is cleared.

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:26.650
Teratani told me everything about yesterday.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.130
Well, that's all.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:30.600
Yoshizuki, wait!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.770
Yoshizuki... I...

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:41.740
Seto-kun?

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.910
Hey, Seto-kun! Snap out of it!

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:46.760
Hey, Seto-kun! Are you all right?

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.030
What am I doing?

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:49.580
Seto-kun! Oh no... what should I do?

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.580
Getting sunstroke at a time like this...

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:50.780
Seto-kun!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.980
Sorry to keep you waiting, Seto-kun!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.520
You're late! Ten whole minutes!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:11.360
Don't whine on about it!

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:12.650
Let's go!

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:15.560
All right! I'll sing all night!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.920
What? Not too much!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.660
You'll ruin Christmas Eve.

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:22.600
Hey! We're here to relax aren't we?

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:24.200
What's wrong with that?

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:28.040
But your singing is just like yelling!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.360
What do you mean yelling?

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:32.970
Doesn't Morisaki seem a little more tense than usual?

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:34.200
My singing voice has alpha waves that make people relax.

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:35.580
I'm sure she's a little nervous.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:37.040
Alpha waves? Are you crazy?

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:41.970
It's true! Kids like you only hear it as yelling.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:38.630
To tell you the truth...

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.940
Oh! You're so annoying!

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:44.940
Morisaki likes Teratani?!

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.450
Pretty unbelievable, right?

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:50.350
I was surprised too, when she told me.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:53.730
Then, today's double date was...?

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:59.200
Yuka told me that she was too embarrassed to simply ask him for a date,

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:02.070
but if we're in a group, she won't feel self-conscious...

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.490
...and Teratani-kun won't feel awkward, right?

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.440
So that's what this was about...

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:10.530
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:14.390
I probably should have let you know sooner...

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:15.700
Yeah...

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:17.560
Is it a problem after all?

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:19.720
Oh, no, not at all!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:22.460
If it's for my best friend, then I'm happy to do it!

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:24.810
Then, let me hear your alpha waves!

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:23.560
Really?

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:27.970
Yeah, we'll definitely get them together before the night's over!

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.970
Sure! I'll let you hear them!

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:30.890
Thank you, Seto-kun.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:35.640
Merry Christmas!

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:39.010
Well then, let's toast!

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:41.210
Oh, wait a second!

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:44.160
We can't have a proper toast with just juice!

00:21:44.810 --> 00:21:46.030
Ta-da!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.530
Champagne!

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:50.160
It's not alcoholic, is it?

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:52.850
Come on. It's Christmas, after all.

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:56.240
Then, let's cut the cake!

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.040
Yeah!

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:03.910
Here, Seto-kun.

00:22:03.910 --> 00:22:04.840
Thank you.

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:08.480
Here, Terata-

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:13.430
Hey, Yoshizuki! You're really nice to Ichitaka!

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:17.940
"Here" she says! I'm so jealous!

00:22:19.380 --> 00:22:22.010
I guess Teratani wants you to give him some cake too.

00:22:22.010 --> 00:22:22.940
Yuka!

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:25.840
What is this now?

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:29.070
Yoshizuki could it be that you like me or something?

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:32.190
Maybe you wanna sit by me, eh?

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:34.250
Well, why not?

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:36.000
Slide on over!

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:40.280
Teratani! You're in the way.

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:42.380
You go over there by Morisaki!

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:47.920
What are you talking about?! You're the one who wants me to sit beside you!

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:49.930
Oh, I get it!

00:22:50.360 --> 00:22:53.850
Seto-kun, you really <i>do</i> like Iori!

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:54.680
What?

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:57.520
There you go. Playing dumb again!

00:22:57.520 --> 00:22:59.960
Idiot! There's no way!

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:02.000
You're so bad at lying!

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:03.820
Come on, Morisaki...

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:08.320
I know.

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.320
Uh, ah...

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:13.600
All right! Let's sing!

00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:16.450
Morisaki, why don't we do a duet?

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:20.210
I guess I've got no choice. I'll have to help you.

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:22.360
Right, let's sing this one!

00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:24.210
Our plan worked.

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:24.870
What? Who would sing such an old song?

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:25.960
What did you say?

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:25.660
Yea.

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:29.230
You should sing "Silent Night" on Christmas!

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:31.100
You have strange tastes!

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:32.290
There's nothing wrong with it!

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:35.720
All right! But just stick to your own part!

00:23:44.270 --> 00:23:46.650
Seto-kun? Are you all right?

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:48.290
Hey, Seto-kun?

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:53.680
Oh, where am I?

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:55.630
We're in the Karaoke Box.

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:57.590
Oh, that's right.

00:23:57.590 --> 00:24:00.080
Today is Christmas.

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:02.570
Oh, no. Are you drunk already?

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:04.670
I'm not drunk!

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:06.630
That was quick, Seto-kun.

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:10.670
I think I'm a little drunk, too.

00:24:11.150 --> 00:24:12.440
Iori-chan!

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:14.510
I mean Yoshizuki...

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:19.160
Iori-chan... Yoshizuki...

00:24:19.160 --> 00:24:20.840
Which do you prefer?

00:24:20.840 --> 00:24:23.070
Either way is fine for me.

00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:25.680
You're so sweet, Yoshizuki!

00:24:25.680 --> 00:24:27.560
Hey, Seto-kun!

00:24:27.560 --> 00:24:30.400
There's no need for you to hug someone like me.

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:31.900
What's that supposed to mean?

00:24:32.530 --> 00:24:34.410
You're not interested in me.

00:24:34.410 --> 00:24:35.690
Not interested?

00:24:35.690 --> 00:24:37.720
Who says I'm not interested in you?

00:24:37.720 --> 00:24:42.410
Wow! You really are drunk.

00:24:43.580 --> 00:24:46.100
Yoshizuki, is there some guy you like?

00:24:46.100 --> 00:24:47.080
What?

00:24:47.080 --> 00:24:49.710
Spit it out, right here in front of everybody!

00:24:49.710 --> 00:24:51.770
Everybody, who?

00:24:51.770 --> 00:24:53.590
They're both gone.

00:24:54.160 --> 00:24:57.550
What are you saying? They're both-

00:25:08.650 --> 00:25:10.820
No way... Why...?

00:25:20.070 --> 00:25:21.450
Why?

00:25:22.720 --> 00:25:26.260
Why are you so curious about who I like?

00:25:29.990 --> 00:25:31.900
Hey. Why?

00:26:01.800 --> 00:26:02.790
Because...

00:26:04.780 --> 00:26:06.040
Because?

00:26:10.010 --> 00:26:11.040
I...

00:26:14.360 --> 00:26:18.050
I like you, Yoshizuki.

00:26:40.970 --> 00:26:48.620
The worn-out diary

00:26:48.620 --> 00:26:56.260
I left behind in a corner of the classroom

00:26:56.260 --> 00:27:04.700
I closed it softly. I hold this throbbing in my heart

00:27:04.700 --> 00:27:15.500
In both hands and warm it up

00:27:15.500 --> 00:27:22.740
Since that day I met you by chance,

00:27:22.740 --> 00:27:30.400
I've grown small wings

00:27:30.400 --> 00:27:37.790
I felt your kind gaze,

00:27:37.790 --> 00:27:45.760
And even now I have a feeling I could fly into the sky

00:27:45.760 --> 00:27:49.350
Staring eyes and eyes
